  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>The Bowcaster is crafted exclusively by the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wookiees\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wookiees\">Wookiees</a> of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Kashyyyk\" title=\"Kashyyyk\">Kashyyyk</a>. A fusion of modern and ancient technologies, the weapon hurls an explosive energy quarrel at incredible speed, much like an archaic rail gun. </p><p><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wookiees\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wookiees\">Wookiees</a> treat Bowcasters as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rifles\" title=\"Rifles\">Rifles</a>, not <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Ranged)\" title=\"Exotic Weapons (Ranged)\">Exotic Weapons (Ranged)</a>. Bowcasters are treated as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rifles\" title=\"Rifles\">Rifles</a> for the purposes of determining weapon <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p><p>A quiver of 10 quarrels costs 50 credits and weighs 1kg. </p><p><b>Accurate:</b> This weapon takes no penalty when firing at targets at Short <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p>",
